OL,3,GNEWSAPassenger dies in van and tractor
OL,4,Acrash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died in a crash involving a
OL,7,Fvan and a tractor on a country road.
OL,9,FThe collision happened on Crane Lane
OL,10,FRow between Woodland and Bishop
OL,11,FAuckland at just before 18:15 BST on
OL,12,FWednesday.
OL,14,FDurham Police said a 60-year-old
OL,15,Fpassenger in the van died at the scene
OL,16,Fand his family is being supported by
OL,17,Fofficers.
OL,19,FThe road remained closed for several
OL,20,Fhours for investigations to begin and
OL,21,Fthe vehicles to be removed.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
